{
  "sn55.53:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 55.53 ",
  "sn55.53:0.2": "6. Sappaññavagga ",
  "sn55.53:0.3": "Dhammadinnasutta ",
  "sn55.53:1.1": "Ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā bārāṇasiyaṁ viharati isipatane migadāye. ",
  "sn55.53:1.2": "Atha kho dhammadinno upāsako pañcahi upāsakasatehi saddhiṁ yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho dhammadinno upāsako bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn55.53:1.3": "“ovadatu no, bhante, bhagavā; ",
  "sn55.53:1.4": "anusāsatu no, bhante, bhagavā yaṁ amhākaṁ assa dīgharattaṁ hitāya sukhāyā”ti. ",
  "sn55.53:2.1": "“Tasmātiha vo, dhammadinna, evaṁ sikkhitabbaṁ: ",
  "sn55.53:2.2": "‘ye te suttantā tathāgatabhāsitā gambhīrā gambhīratthā lokuttarā suññatapaṭisaṁyuttā te kālena kālaṁ upasampajja viharissāmā’ti. ",
  "sn55.53:2.3": "Evañhi vo, dhammadinna, sikkhitabban”ti. ",
  "sn55.53:2.4": "“Na kho netaṁ, bhante, sukaraṁ amhehi puttasambādhasayanaṁ ajjhāvasantehi kāsikacandanaṁ paccanubhontehi mālāgandhavilepanaṁ dhārayantehi jātarūparajataṁ sādiyantehi—",
  "sn55.53:2.5": "ye te suttantā tathāgatabhāsitā gambhīrā gambhīratthā lokuttarā suññatapaṭisaṁyuttā te kālena kālaṁ upasampajja viharituṁ. ",
  "sn55.53:2.6": "Tesaṁ no, bhante, bhagavā amhākaṁ pañcasu sikkhāpadesu ṭhitānaṁ uttaridhammaṁ desetū”ti. ",
  "sn55.53:3.1": "“Tasmātiha vo, dhammadinna, evaṁ sikkhitabbaṁ: "